0..66 Comment "//! `suspended` resumes an access that holds a view of a variable."
67..70 Comment "//!"
71..147 Comment "//! The reified stack retains the view outside its source frame. The checker"
148..200 Comment "//! reports `ViewEscaped` for the `dangling` source."
201..204 Comment "//!"
205..258 Comment "//! The source imports the host early exit interface."
259..321 Comment "//! The handler resumes after `exit`. The source runs to `12`."
322..325 Comment "//!"
326..388 Comment "//! Rust uses `Pin` from RFC 2349 for a self-borrowing future."
389..441 Comment "//! C++ keeps such an object immobile by convention."
442..474 Comment "//! - see: #1183 — `suspended`"
